OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies to help shape maternity
OL,4,Acare improvements
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe board aims to ensure voices of
OL,7,Ffamilies affected by the maternity
OL,8,Freview remain central to improvement
OL,9,Fwork carried out by Nottingham
OL,10,FUniversity Hospitals NHS Trust (NUH).
OL,12,FOckenden told the BBC: "Nottingham has
OL,13,Fa long history of having really
OL,14,Fsuccessful family engagement, but that
OL,15,Fwas because those families had to
OL,16,Ffight."
